@startuml Generate Alerts
title Generate Alerts

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor User
participant UI
control Controller

User->UI: initAlters()
UI-->User: alert choices(low stock and near-expiry)

User->UI: generateAlert(alert)
UI->Controller: generateAlert(alert)

alt Low Stock Alert
    Controller->PersistenceHandler: getInventory(low-stock)

else
    Controller->PersistenceHandler: getInventory(near-expiry)

end

PersistenceHandler-->Controller: desired inventory

loop for each item

    create participant Product
    Controller->Product: <<create>>
    Controller->Controller: addItem(product)

end


Controller-->UI: products' details
UI-->User: render products' details

participant Product
participant PersistenceHandler

@enduml